Components NOT distributed with this repository
================================================================================

This repository REFERENCES, but does not contain, the following licensed IP.
It is resolved at build time from a separately-licensed installation via the
environment variables documented in set_env.sh. No vendor RTL is committed here.

  * Arm Corstone-101 / BP210 (CMSDK)   — via $CMSDK_DIR, $CMSDK_FPGA_SRAM_V
  * Arm XHB-500 bus bridge generator   — via $XHB500_IP_DIR; output is generated
                                          into deps/xhb500/generated/ (gitignored)

Users must obtain their own licence for these components from Arm.
